{"unit_id":"stuarthu__dsh-hot-reload#card-zh","repo":"stuarthu/dsh-hot-reload","commit":"006d91589e8edab031e46dea936db0cc0f301e02","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reload 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件热重载扩展：它接入 DSH 插件加载器，并监视 profile 中的 pnpm-lock.yaml，在已加载插件升级后清理其模块缓存、重新导入代码并原位替换运行实例。主要功能包括检测依赖版本变化、失败时恢复旧实例、持久化已处理版本，以及在终端和 Web 界面提示结果。适合希望升级插件后继续使用当前 DSH 会话的用户；需要 Node.js 22 及以上版本，并在本地 profile 写入状态文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:56","lib/index.js:260","lib/index.js:390","lib/index.js:560"]}
{"unit_id":"stuarthu__dsh-hot-reload#card-en","repo":"stuarthu/dsh-hot-reload","commit":"006d91589e8edab031e46dea936db0cc0f301e02","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hot-reload watches a DSH profile lockfile and reloads upgraded plugins in place. It invalidates caches, imports new code, and restores the old instance if startup fails. It tracks versions and reports results in terminal and Web. Requires Node.js 22+ and a profile state file.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:56","lib/index.js:260","lib/index.js:390","lib/index.js:560"]}
