{"unit_id":"stuarthu__dsh-hot-reload#feature-1","repo":"stuarthu/dsh-hot-reload","commit":"006d91589e8edab031e46dea936db0cc0f301e02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reload 的功能「升级后原位重载」：当 profile 的 pnpm-lock.yaml 变化且已加载插件版本不同，插件会失效其包内模块缓存、导入新代码并替换运行中的插件实例。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:260","lib/index.js:390"]}
{"unit_id":"stuarthu__dsh-hot-reload#feature-2","repo":"stuarthu/dsh-hot-reload","commit":"006d91589e8edab031e46dea936db0cc0f301e02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reload 的功能「失败时恢复旧版本」：新代码导入或启动失败时，插件会移除新实例并重新挂载旧实例；该版本不会自动再次尝试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:390","lib/index.js:470"]}
{"unit_id":"stuarthu__dsh-hot-reload#feature-3","repo":"stuarthu/dsh-hot-reload","commit":"006d91589e8edab031e46dea936db0cc0f301e02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reload 的功能「保存版本跟踪状态」：插件把已提交版本及失败、已通知版本写入 profile 状态文件，并以临时文件加重命名方式保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45","lib/index.js:510"]}
{"unit_id":"stuarthu__dsh-hot-reload#feature-4","repo":"stuarthu/dsh-hot-reload","commit":"006d91589e8edab031e46dea936db0cc0f301e02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reload 的功能「显示重载结果」：每次重载结果会写入日志和标准错误；Web 客户端通过事件流接收通知并显示短暂提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:91","lib/index.js:720","lib/client.js:25"]}
